{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26168","headline":"日南长至 · 独孤铉","name":"日南长至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉历颁新律，凝阴发一阳。\n轮辉犹惜短，圭影此偏长。\n晷度经南斗，流晶尽北堂。\n乍疑周户耀，可爱逗林光。\n积雪销微照，初萌动早芒。\n更升台上望，云物已昭彰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}